    SLiCE Excel Column HeaderFull Environmental Indicator NameTarget Ontology Property / Class Alignmentindicator_GWPGlobal Warming Potential (total)lca:hasGWP / lca:GlobalWarmingPotentialindicator_PMParticulate Matter emissionslca:hasPM / lca:ParticulateMatterindicator_EPEutrophication Potentiallca:hasEP / lca:EutrophicationPotentialindicator_aciAcidification Potentiallca:hasAP / lca:AcidificationPotentialindicator_pofPhotochemical Ozone Formation (Smog)lca:hasPOCP / lca:PhotochemicalOzoneCreationPotentialindicator_HTcHuman Toxicity, cancer effectslca:hasHT_c / lca:HumanToxicityCancerindicator_HTncHuman Toxicity, non-cancer effectslca:hasHT_nc / lca:HumanToxicityNonCancerindicator_irhhIonising Radiation, human healthlca:hasIR / lca:IonisingRadiationindicator_ecofwEcotoxicity, freshwaterlca:hasET_fw / lca:FreshwaterEcotoxicityindicator_wsWater Scarcity / Water Uselca:hasWU / lca:WaterUse
